98005931956", "personaname": "DisaFear", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/disafear/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 481, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 427, "last_played": 1782505423, "avatar": "03c6e7194658f9b29d1f35e628ad779259d0ec48"}, "language": "english", "review": "The ultimate immersive Space Marine experience", "timestamp_created": 1781562318, "timestamp_updated": 1781562318, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "hardware": {"system_ram": "31784", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 7 9700X 8-Core Processor             ", "adapter_description": "AMD  Radeon RX 7800 XT", "vram_size": 16177}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "228059704", "author": {"steamid": "76561199089423185", "personaname": "Drahgin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DrahginTTV/", "num_games_owned": 69, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 8748, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 120, "playtime_at_review": 4220, "last_played": 1788056482, "avatar": "1a24480f72d5b0b199caea03a1866e1eeac489f7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Smash little bugs and Smash Evil dudes pretty simple", "timestamp_created": 1781561947, "timestamp_updated": 1781561947, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32694", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 7 5800XT 8-Core Processor            ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5050", "vram_size": 7910}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "228059310", "author": {"steamid": "76561198869301313", "personaname": "Johithestar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198869301313/", "num_games_owned": 95, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 2195, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2041, "last_played": 1783291897, "avatar": "0057b1a47e94ce16430c478c86937743300bf958"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is very weird to me.\r\n\r\nSpace marine 2 is trying to be multiple genres at once, a horde shooter like the tide series from Fat shark, a hero shooter and a daily/weekly grind game while also not knowing if to focus on melee or ranged combat.\r\n\r\nId have to say that this game is a game for a wide variety of people but not for those that want something specific made well.\r\n\r\nThe customization is absolutely great, the models look insane but you either earn them through insane grinds that can last tens and tens of hours or you can just buy DLCs that already have top models in them.\r\n\r\nThe fighting (the most important part) is good all things considered, it mixes ranged and melee quite well and the hits feel crunchy yet something lacks be that the hitbox size being a bit too small in my opinion or the base tyranid units not immiediatelly dying but requiring a couple of shots or melee hits.\r\n\r\nThe bosses are insanely fun with some of them repeating like the roaming bosses (carnifex, Hellbrute etc) but the mission specific bosses always have a nice gimmick to them.\r\n\r\nI cannot say anything about PvP as i have not touched it.\r\n\r\nThe classes feel good and all have a purpose, going from a generalist to all gun to all melee to all melee but with a jetpack. You have options on options with 2 \"Heavy\" classes, 2 fast moving classes, a sniper class and 2 generalist classes.\r\n\r\nThe thing that this games lack BY FAR is music, games like Darktide, Vermintide 2 and other Warhammer games like Rogue trader or even Deathwing have incredible music, yet this game has it either so quiet you cant hear it, or so boring that your brain filters it out.\r\n\r\nOverall this game is a blast to play once u have a couple of hours to spare at a time, I reccomend playing around 2 games then stopping as it provides a lot of fun for around 1 and a half hours.\r\n\r\n8/10 \r\nThe Emperor Protects.", "timestamp_created": 1781561542, "timestamp_updated": 1781561542, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "228059045", "author": {"steamid": "76561199206646648", "personaname": "Zombie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199206646648/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 4608, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1242, "last_played": 1783633807, "avatar": "72fdf142af9bfd2963b70077335811095f2db9be"}, "language": "english", "review": "FUN", "timestamp_created": 1781561274, "timestamp_updated": 1781561274, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}]}